---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">IBM i engineering, modernization, and leadership</p>
        <h1>Real Code.<br />Real Coffee.<br />No Nonsense.</h1>
        <p class="lede">The RPG Blend is George Van Eaton's practical body of work on IBM i modernization, RPG development, SQL architecture, AI-assisted engineering, and technical leadership.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button primary" href="#articles">Explore the work</a>
          <a class="button" href="#academy">Visit the Academy</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Core belief</p>
        <h2>Modernization is not a rewrite.</h2>
        <p>It is the disciplined transformation of systems, architecture, teams, and understanding—without destroying inherited business value.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section id="articles">
      <p class="eyebrow">The publication</p>
      <h2>Practical thinking for long-lived systems</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>IBM i Modernization</h3><p>Frameworks for improving systems responsibly, incrementally, and with clear business purpose.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>RPG & SQL Engineering</h3><p>Architecture, code quality, database design, testing, and delivery practices for modern IBM i teams.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Engineering Leadership</h3><p>Hiring, coaching, change leadership, knowledge transfer, and building teams that can sustain the platform.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="academy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The RPG Blend Academy</p>
      <h2>Build the next generation of IBM i engineers</h2>
      <p class="lede">A structured learning path for new RPG developers, experienced engineers modernizing their skills, and leaders building sustainable IBM i teams.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="press">
      <p class="eyebrow">The RPG Blend Press</p>
      <h2>Field guides, books, and practical tools</h2>
      <p class="lede">The Press turns real IBM i engineering experience into durable publications that readers can apply Monday morning.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <p class="eyebrow">About George</p>
      <h2>Three decades of IBM i experience, preserved and shared</h2>
      <p class="lede">George Van Eaton is an IBM i engineering leader, author of The RPG Blend, and a contributing author to the IBM Redbooks work-in-progress publication <em>Modernizing IBM i Applications</em> (MD260020).</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
